/E (+-----------------------------------------------------------------+ | HOST OPERATING SYSTEM \(WINDOWS/LINUX\) | | | | +--------------------------+ +-----------------------+ | | | | | | | | | SRE/RPA DAEMON THREAD |=====>| SQLITE3 DATABASE | | | | \(Python Logic Engine\) | | \(Persistent Disk\) | | | | | | | | | +--------------------------+ +-----------------------+ | | || | | | | || Reads Kernel | Pushes State | Reads History | | \\/ v v | | +----------+ +------------------------------------------+ | | | POS UI | | TELEMETRY SERVER THREAD | | | | CLIENTS | | \(Flask WSGI / SocketIO\) | | | +----------+ +------------------------------------------+ | | || || | | || OS Interrupts || Full-Duplex WebSockets | | \\/ \\/ | | +----------+ +------------------------------------------+ | | | PHYSICAL | | BROWSER PRESENTATION LAYER | | | | HARDWARE | | \(HTML5 / CSS3 / Chart.js\) | | | +----------+ +------------------------------------------+ | +-----------------------------------------------------------------+)
/Pg 14 0 R
