215 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 112 0 R
/E (The architecture deliberately does not implement automated cron-based data purging or truncation. Disk space management is deferred to the host operating system or periodic administrative archival, ensuring that critical financial telemetry is never accidentally destroyed by the automation engine.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
