723 0 obj
<<
/Title (For future developers or system integrators who may inherit this project for mass deployment across a retail franchise, this HLD serves as the initial onboarding manual. It answers the fundamental questions of "what" the system does and "how" the major components interact, before developers dive into the "why" and "how precisely" found within the source code and Low-Level Design.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 681 0 R
/Next 727 0 R
>>
endobj
